WEBVTT

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
FANSUB GROUP AZALIA PRESENTS

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
Worked on the series:
Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, February

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
How did I become

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
queen

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:06.530
All characters are fictitious

00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:08.700
and the events shown are fiction.

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:54.380
Did Hong find out anything?

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:56.980
Apparently, Kim Byunin guessed

00:01:56.980 --> 00:01:58.800
that the piece of fabric he found was from the palace.

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:00.620
He's getting closer.

00:02:01.050 --> 00:02:02.350
Let's hurry up too.

00:02:29.850 --> 00:02:32.350
-We are learning not to attack.
-Is it true?

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:40.620
What's wrong with you?

00:02:41.190 --> 00:02:43.090
Losing your mind is not in your rules.

00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:46.660
I've been holding back for too long
I'm tired of waiting.

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:06.550
Dangerous Liaisons

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:12.820
Episode 8

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:34.380
Hold it.

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:39.380
Well, let's go.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:51.490
Did you go hunting?

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:55.700
As they say: "Rest..."

00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:00.570
"Rest and wait until they get tired."

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:03.640
While I rest, my enemies get tired.

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:06.280
You're right.

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:10.080
But how did you catch a hare without a bow?

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:16.020
The bow made my hands and fingers hurt.

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:19.620
I'm sure it wasn't invented for hunting.

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:22.290
but to torture people.

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:27.100
Although, if your hands and fingers hurt after it,

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:28.930
then for hunting people - just right.

00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:35.970
In any case, the animals are easier to trap.

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:39.480
It's dangerous for you to hunt with just the two of you.

00:04:39.740 --> 00:04:44.080
The guard must guard you wherever you go.

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:46.460
Next time I'll take it with me.

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:52.520
By the way, are you still the head of the king’s guard?

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:54.420
When the queen's father gets better,

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:56.390
I will relinquish this responsibility.

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:58.160
Exactly.

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:01.000
For your health -

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:02.370
accept.

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:05.400
Everything is fine. No need.

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:07.000
Don't refuse me.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:09.110
This is a gift from the king.

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:11.370
Got you.

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:21.820
Did you hear - the queen woke up?

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:23.420
Is it true?

00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:25.390
How is she feeling?

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:28.190
Fortunately, Her Majesty is healthy.

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:31.860
She overcame her illness.
What a relief.

00:05:32.830 --> 00:05:35.100
I must see Her Majesty.

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:46.440
God.

00:05:49.610 --> 00:05:51.210
Now is not the time for visits.

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:53.150
Since the queen is better,

00:05:53.150 --> 00:05:54.780
we avoided the worst outcome.

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:56.920
I'll look for the ledger myself.

00:05:56.920 --> 00:05:58.190
I'll go with you.

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:01.990
This will only make them wary.

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:04.560
Keep an eye on everything that happens in the palace.

00:06:18.340 --> 00:06:20.510
The weather is nice today.

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:22.810
You won't catch it!

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:32.260
It smelled like spring.

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:39.560
Will you marry me?

00:06:39.860 --> 00:06:42.330
I may not have come out with my face,
but I have a goat.

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:47.000
Well, I don't know.

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:51.410
Your Majesty!

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:06.720
I wanted her to come back so bad.

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:09.830
And only her memories returned.

00:07:10.390 --> 00:07:13.000
Previously, they appeared as outbreaks here and there.

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:16.400
Every time I had a headache and a ringing in my ears.

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:19.900
But this time the memories appeared without special effects.

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:25.910
Hongyeon, you will be 19 this year.

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:28.480
But your name is not Hongyong.

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:30.510
Hong is a surname, and your name is Yeon.

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:33.380
My sense of smell.

00:07:33.380 --> 00:07:35.320
Smells help you remember.

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:38.620
But why

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:40.920
Am I that good at playing?

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:44.090
You have played the gayageum since childhood.

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:51.400
Your memory is back

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:53.000
Here the talents have awakened.

00:07:55.810 --> 00:07:57.010
What a crap.

00:07:57.470 --> 00:08:00.480
As soon as I was a vegetable, everything went wrong.

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:02.350
Stop.

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:05.180
Why did the voice in my head become female?

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:11.050
What am I,

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:13.190
lost your voice?

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:15.360
What are you talking about?

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:17.430
I can hear you perfectly.

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:21.460
The strength has returned to my fingers
but the voice disappeared. Just like

00:08:22.570 --> 00:08:23.800
in "The Little Mermaid"?

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:28.940
Find out so that there is no doubt about the words of the witness,

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:30.840
who sold arsenic to the court lady Khan

00:08:31.140 --> 00:08:35.040
as a poison for mice, and how the poison got into the king's kitchen.

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:43.820
I have business with the head of the Detective Department.

00:08:46.060 --> 00:08:47.160
How strange.

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:50.330
The palace has always been big

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:53.830
but today it is especially huge and empty.

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.800
Her Majesty is coming.

00:09:25.590 --> 00:09:28.130
Am I...

00:09:28.930 --> 00:09:31.500
I agreed to give the Queen Mother some time.

00:09:32.740 --> 00:09:34.300
-What?
-That's the order

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:35.640
courtyard.

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:37.410
For now we'll wait.

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:40.410
But have all the evidence ready

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:42.220
to use them at any time.

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:45.610
Keep them secret.

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:48.350
Maybe we were able to piece together the whole picture,

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:50.420
but the queen mother may be related

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:52.220
with those who want to harm the queen.

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:56.060
If we leave her alone,
Her Majesty may be in danger again.

00:09:56.260 --> 00:09:58.230
People who want to harm the queen?

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:02.160
The Queen admitted that she wanted to kill herself by throwing herself into the pond.

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:04.370
This time her health failed her.

00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:06.870
What are we talking about?

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:16.250
She became a target as soon as she crossed the threshold of the palace.

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:17.680
This is what worries me.

00:10:18.580 --> 00:10:19.750
Understand.

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:22.990
Organize a meeting without a king -

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:24.820
it's still a headache.

00:10:24.920 --> 00:10:25.960
I'll go.

00:10:26.090 --> 00:10:27.960
Has something happened to His Majesty?

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:30.130
He went to the queen.

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:32.560
Really?

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:35.970
Benin!

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:39.900
Didn't know you were here.

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:41.640
You can continue.

00:10:41.940 --> 00:10:43.970
It's good for you to get home.

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:48.580
It's midday
Why are you sending him home?

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:50.480
I didn't sleep all night, so I got it wrong.

00:10:54.180 --> 00:10:56.390
What were you working on if you confuse day and night?

00:10:56.390 --> 00:10:59.160
I was on a secret mission all night.

00:10:59.160 --> 00:11:02.220
I suffered such fear.

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:07.030
So, did you learn anything?

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:09.200
Benin, I'm lost.

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:13.740
Fell in love with a woman I shouldn't have.

00:11:14.700 --> 00:11:16.040
And who is she?

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:18.740
For some reason the palace is especially empty today,

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:20.180
empty in my heart too.

00:11:20.510 --> 00:11:23.450
I kept wondering what was wrong with me.

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:26.850
And now in the palace there is only

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:28.420
one woman.

00:11:29.820 --> 00:11:31.050
Her Majesty.

00:11:31.650 --> 00:11:33.820
I think I've fallen in love with the queen.

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:36.830
-What?
-How could I fall in love with my sister?

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:39.430
This is against the law on incest.

00:11:39.430 --> 00:11:40.630
We are from the same family.

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:43.530
It's the same as incest.

00:11:43.530 --> 00:11:47.440
As if this were not enough, she is a stranger’s woman and married to the king.

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:48.940
I'm crazy.

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:51.940
No, that's putting it mildly
I lost all my brains on the road.

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:54.240
Even if you forget about all this,

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:55.480
what is more important -

00:11:55.640 --> 00:11:58.510
she is much older than me.

00:11:58.580 --> 00:12:00.080
Is this normal?

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:02.120
Are you still worried about her age?!

00:12:02.350 --> 00:12:04.390
Why are you yelling at me?

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:06.760
You are talking outright nonsense.

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:07.960
Sorry.

00:12:08.560 --> 00:12:10.360
I won't say anything more.

00:12:12.430 --> 00:12:14.700
No, it's okay.
Sorry for yelling.

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:16.340
You never once raised your voice at me,

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:18.470
and I never got angry.

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:20.670
You have changed a lot since your appointment.

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:22.300
Yes, it's up to my neck.

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:24.710
I wasn't angry at you.

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:29.010
How did you even come to this conclusion?

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:32.550
Everything around reminds me of her.

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:35.450
How she held the Queen's umbrella

00:12:35.550 --> 00:12:37.720
how she stayed next to her,

00:12:37.720 --> 00:12:41.390
how she ran with a decoction for Her Majesty.

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:44.790
All I can think about is Hong Young, the Queen's lady-in-waiting.

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:48.630
If you think about Hong Young,

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:50.530
why did you decide that you fell in love with the queen?

00:12:50.570 --> 00:12:51.830
Have you forgotten who I am?

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:53.340
I am the 16th descendant and first son

00:12:53.340 --> 00:12:54.840
for 3 generations in the family of judges.

00:12:54.840 --> 00:12:56.240
I'm Kim Hwan.

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:59.380
Can I fall in love
some court lady?

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:01.510
Therefore, I am sure that in my heart...

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:07.520
Did I fall in love with a court lady?!

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:14.160
Good luck to you on the thorny path of love.

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:23.700
Initial Instruction for Children

00:13:30.840 --> 00:13:33.710
Cho Hwajin

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:54.830
Your Highness.

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:00.370
Where is the king?

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:02.470
He went to the queen's house.

00:14:03.140 --> 00:14:05.410
Why so suddenly?

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:07.110
The Queen regained consciousness.

00:14:07.210 --> 00:14:09.950
He wants to take the opportunity to search her house.

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:15.220
Are you hurt?

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:17.490
It's OK.

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:24.630
Then I will also visit the queen.

00:14:37.970 --> 00:14:39.580
To what do I owe this pleasure?

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:57.990
Skinny

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:00.430
thick,

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:03.130
high

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:04.900
and low.

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:07.670
All different sizes and heights.

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:10.870
But they all have one thing in common.

00:15:11.270 --> 00:15:12.310
This

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:15.080
your eyes.

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:19.850
You have the best vision and aim.

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:23.190
You are the shooters I handpicked.

00:15:23.590 --> 00:15:26.290
And I have average height and weight.

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:27.960
What type am I?

00:15:27.960 --> 00:15:29.590
You'll be slow-witted.

00:15:33.430 --> 00:15:36.130
And that's what I called your squad.

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:38.100
Les Misérables.

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:40.670
You were sent to the front line,

00:15:40.670 --> 00:15:43.140
because they were considered nonentities.

00:15:43.510 --> 00:15:45.070
But with these guns

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:48.180
you will become the best warriors of Joseon.

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:50.750
Like me.

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:57.120
A gun can take a life.

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:04.360
But also

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:08.760
might save her.

00:16:09.470 --> 00:16:11.300
Line up five in a row to shoot.

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:21.040
It's troublesome, but I have to save this country.

00:16:24.680 --> 00:16:25.710
Fire!

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:35.490
I came to pick up what I need.

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:39.600
The first is a phoenix hairpin.

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:41.800
Phoenix hairpin?

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:44.900
A gift for the queen?

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:48.370
If only for the queen,
I would ask for Saniywon.

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:53.880
I don't need a gold royal phoenix clip.

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:56.040
I need the one made of jade.

00:16:56.850 --> 00:17:00.920
But according to royal etiquette, only the queen

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:04.020
can wear phoenix hairpins.

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:05.290
Exactly.

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:13.460
And the second thing I need is...

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:21.500
I knew it. She wants to seduce the king there.

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:26.640
Quicker. We must finish with a bullet.

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:29.210
Yes. Quicker.

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:36.290
Before the queen tells him the secret.

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:43.730
There is one difference between me and the little mermaid.

00:17:44.590 --> 00:17:47.800
She got legs for her vote, and I got arms.

00:17:48.260 --> 00:17:50.130
Surprise after surprise.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:52.270
So will I lose myself drop by drop?

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:54.240
If I stay here

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:57.770
this bastard, Director Khan,
will get everything he wants.

00:17:58.370 --> 00:17:59.980
I can accuse his ancestors of treason,

00:17:59.980 --> 00:18:02.680
hunt down the Khans and destroy the entire family.

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:05.580
I will destroy three generations of Khans,

00:18:05.580 --> 00:18:07.180
so that they could not conceive him.

00:18:09.180 --> 00:18:11.390
But to which clan do they belong?

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:14.460
Why does her mood constantly change?

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:22.700
Are you all from the Namsadan troupe here?

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:24.070
Where do these skills come from?

00:18:24.530 --> 00:18:27.670
For Joseon women, this is nothing.

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:30.370
This is the only way to look behind the walls.

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:34.610
I didn't know what the deep meaning was.

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:37.550
And it's true. After living here for a week, I realized

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:40.080
that the life of a Joseon woman is much harder than I expected.

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:42.780
And by the way, I’m also the queen here.

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:47.920
But if I can take bloody revenge...

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:49.490
Let's go.

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:54.400
Everything will be fine if you don't smell.

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:55.930
Memories will not return.

00:18:55.930 --> 00:18:57.470
And my voice will return.

00:18:57.630 --> 00:19:00.600
From this day forward I will live for revenge.

00:19:00.940 --> 00:19:03.410
And for this I need power.

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:04.940
Hong Young.

00:19:04.940 --> 00:19:08.340
What, as a queen, must I do to gain unprecedented power?

00:19:09.510 --> 00:19:11.280
I know the best way to gain power.

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:14.120
Which one?

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:17.750
Producing an heir will give you the most power.

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:20.920
Production?

00:19:20.920 --> 00:19:22.720
What kind of word is this inhumane?

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:25.390
Exactly.

00:19:25.860 --> 00:19:28.460
For me, the super-powerful Sunwon.

00:19:28.660 --> 00:19:30.100
Who is Sunwon?

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:32.230
Such a village name.

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:35.070
Queen Sunwon. She's the Dowager Queen.

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:39.310
Hong Young, if I want to impress her,

00:19:39.310 --> 00:19:42.140
-what do I need...
-Give birth to an heir. Exactly.

00:19:42.140 --> 00:19:44.610
I'll get her a gift. What could you come up with?

00:19:44.610 --> 00:19:47.620
Something small and shiny
expensive and beautiful.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:50.590
Wait a minute.

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:54.290
This smell...

00:19:56.830 --> 00:19:59.600
Memories come back, come back...

00:20:20.220 --> 00:20:22.680
This repository is called Heaven. What's in the backyard is the Earth.

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:24.250
And what's next to the guest room - Black?

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:26.220
Yes. Your father accumulated wealth while you were away.

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:28.420
All storage facilities are full.

00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:31.290
Sky, Earth, Black...

00:20:32.590 --> 00:20:35.160
If you think about all the warehouses in Joseon, not just these...

00:20:35.160 --> 00:20:37.470
Your family had to use all the Chinese characters.

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:41.000
Oh, my little eyes!

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:44.040
Look, I was born with a golden spoon in my mouth.

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:47.540
This.

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:51.410
And this.

00:20:52.780 --> 00:20:54.220
And besides them,

00:20:55.850 --> 00:20:57.320
pack everything else.

00:20:58.590 --> 00:20:59.650
Everything else?

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:02.060
Let's take everything and return to the palace.

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:05.660
Your father will have a blow.

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:08.530
From this day forward, I will be the Queen of Lobbying.

00:21:10.670 --> 00:21:11.670
Your Majesty.

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:15.370
The king has arrived.

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:18.340
Why is this still necessary?

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:20.340
I'll be back soon myself.

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:22.040
Tell me to let him wait for me in the palace.

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:25.980
What are you saying?

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:28.220
I need to show my devotion to grandma.

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:29.950
And stay away from the king.

00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:34.160
What are you doing?

00:21:46.570 --> 00:21:49.570
I need to clearly show which side I'm on.

00:21:49.570 --> 00:21:50.740
Here I grabbed it.

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:54.810
Why is he in full dress?

00:21:56.380 --> 00:21:58.080
All these royal families are such show-offs.

00:21:58.480 --> 00:22:00.380
Show the king your respect.

00:22:01.780 --> 00:22:02.850
Everything is fine.

00:22:18.030 --> 00:22:21.600
So, I nominate Soyeon from the Kim family as queen.

00:22:28.180 --> 00:22:29.880
Congratulations on your election.

00:22:57.740 --> 00:22:59.040
Picked it up on the way here.

00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:05.150
My queen.

00:23:07.780 --> 00:23:09.780
You blushed. And you breathe faster.

00:23:10.590 --> 00:23:12.250
Are you having difficulty breathing again?

00:23:14.060 --> 00:23:15.860
My face is fine and I'm breathing normally.

00:23:16.730 --> 00:23:18.590
I just overate this morning.

00:23:19.690 --> 00:23:20.900
Go away, Soyeon.

00:23:20.900 --> 00:23:23.170
Get out of me... That is, get out of this body immediately.

00:23:23.170 --> 00:23:24.700
What are you doing?

00:23:24.930 --> 00:23:27.100
I have nowhere else to go.

00:23:27.100 --> 00:23:29.740
Is this how you destroy flowers or your body?

00:23:30.170 --> 00:23:32.510
Hey, why do you keep...

00:23:33.280 --> 00:23:34.910
- That's enough already.
-Get lost.

00:23:34.910 --> 00:23:37.980
I won't give it away, he's mine!

00:23:38.980 --> 00:23:41.350
I didn't know you'd like them so much.

00:23:42.020 --> 00:23:43.250
I didn't say I liked it.

00:23:43.250 --> 00:23:45.320
I just think it's better to stay here
than living in a corpse.

00:23:45.320 --> 00:23:48.620
How do you manage
waking up more and more strange?

00:23:49.590 --> 00:23:52.130
I'm not the only one who's weird here. You have a lot of weird things yourself.

00:23:52.130 --> 00:23:54.160
“Picked them up on the way here”? Seriously?

00:23:54.530 --> 00:23:56.870
Have they been driving such a blizzard for a couple of centuries already?

00:23:57.200 --> 00:23:58.530
But I actually picked them up along the way.

00:23:58.530 --> 00:24:01.170
Well, yes, of course, great, bravo.

00:24:01.170 --> 00:24:03.310
This is true.

00:24:03.310 --> 00:24:04.740
I really believe it, I believe it.

00:24:05.410 --> 00:24:07.440
The king never lies.

00:24:07.440 --> 00:24:10.010
-Well, yes, well, yes, yeah, yeah.
-What's wrong with you?

00:24:10.010 --> 00:24:13.180
- How is that possible? What is it?
-Your Majesty.

00:24:14.580 --> 00:24:16.590
Your Majesty.

00:24:18.190 --> 00:24:21.690
You blessed our humble abode with your visit.

00:24:22.160 --> 00:24:24.390
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:24:25.090 --> 00:24:26.960
Please stand up.

00:24:29.900 --> 00:24:32.230
I had to check on my queen and make sure everything was okay.

00:24:32.770 --> 00:24:35.400
How are you doing? Are you okay?

00:24:35.400 --> 00:24:37.310
Yes, sure.

00:24:38.070 --> 00:24:40.440
Let's go in.

00:24:41.210 --> 00:24:42.640
-Certainly.
-Great.

00:24:45.780 --> 00:24:48.080
My King, enjoy your hospitality.

00:24:48.080 --> 00:24:50.290
And I need to prepare to return to the palace.

00:24:50.490 --> 00:24:52.650
- Let's go.
-What? Are you leaving already?

00:24:53.760 --> 00:24:55.520
Do you want to go back to the palace today?

00:24:56.630 --> 00:24:58.330
I'm recovering quickly.

00:24:58.730 --> 00:25:00.430
Even so,

00:25:01.060 --> 00:25:04.030
You just recovered.

00:25:04.030 --> 00:25:05.670
Father is right.

00:25:06.200 --> 00:25:09.170
There is no need to rush, you need to fully recover.

00:25:13.280 --> 00:25:16.340
I'm worried that the courtyard will fight without me.

00:25:17.150 --> 00:25:18.880
Everything is calm in the courtyard.

00:25:18.880 --> 00:25:20.920
Calmer than when you were in the palace.

00:25:22.950 --> 00:25:24.320
Much calmer.

00:25:25.490 --> 00:25:26.620
Sorry.

00:25:28.120 --> 00:25:29.720
I tried my best

00:25:30.790 --> 00:25:33.560
but it seems you are unhappy with me.

00:25:33.700 --> 00:25:36.130
-Yes I...
-You're already used to the palace.

00:25:36.770 --> 00:25:39.000
and spend time with dad

00:25:39.000 --> 00:25:41.240
you don't like it at all.

00:25:41.570 --> 00:25:43.000
God.

00:25:44.770 --> 00:25:48.780
I concentrated
on duty as queen

00:25:49.240 --> 00:25:51.450
and didn’t think about your feelings at all, father.

00:25:52.080 --> 00:25:55.350
I will return to the palace tomorrow.

00:25:57.050 --> 00:26:01.060
If so, I invite you two to the guest house.

00:26:04.830 --> 00:26:05.930
I fell for the trick.

00:26:07.260 --> 00:26:08.360
Let's go.

00:26:12.970 --> 00:26:15.070
What fly bit her?

00:26:32.680 --> 00:26:34.950
There is a task for you.

00:26:35.350 --> 00:26:38.920
Bring me something that shouldn't exist.

00:26:44.060 --> 00:26:47.260
From a hiding place in the queen's father's chambers.

00:26:48.500 --> 00:26:49.500
Yes.

00:26:56.340 --> 00:26:59.610
I'm glad to see you here together.

00:26:59.770 --> 00:27:02.080
So happy that I don’t mind dying.

00:27:02.540 --> 00:27:05.880
I should have visited you earlier.
I'm sorry.

00:27:06.750 --> 00:27:08.620
There's nothing to apologize for.

00:27:09.420 --> 00:27:12.450
It's enough for me to hear

00:27:15.920 --> 00:27:18.990
how you love each other.

00:27:22.960 --> 00:27:25.800
My queen is so different from other women

00:27:25.800 --> 00:27:28.670
I was always interested to see where she grew up.

00:27:30.670 --> 00:27:32.410
This is the place.

00:27:32.710 --> 00:27:34.980
I raised her alone, without a mother,

00:27:35.240 --> 00:27:37.080
so I tried especially hard

00:27:37.080 --> 00:27:39.050
give her all the care she needs.

00:27:39.680 --> 00:27:41.820
It must have been hard.

00:27:42.320 --> 00:27:44.490
Well, no, not at all.

00:27:45.120 --> 00:27:47.290
The Queen did a good job herself

00:27:47.320 --> 00:27:49.520
from a young age.

00:27:51.330 --> 00:27:54.860
Yes, I've heard that.

00:27:55.030 --> 00:27:57.200
However, she is so strong and independent,

00:27:57.370 --> 00:27:59.630
that he doesn't share his feelings with me.

00:28:00.030 --> 00:28:01.840
Am I that stupid?

00:28:02.100 --> 00:28:04.410
Or is it impossible to understand what is on a woman's mind?

00:28:04.910 --> 00:28:08.140
It's terribly difficult for me to understand her.

00:28:08.140 --> 00:28:11.610
God, it's definitely not due to lack of intelligence.

00:28:11.750 --> 00:28:13.880
All men find it difficult to understand women.

00:28:14.080 --> 00:28:17.450
They are as complex as the Buddha's teachings.

00:28:18.520 --> 00:28:19.950
Don't try to understand.

00:28:20.320 --> 00:28:23.460
Marital relationships are filled with misunderstandings.

00:28:25.090 --> 00:28:26.430
What does it mean?

00:28:27.200 --> 00:28:28.700
No misunderstandings

00:28:28.700 --> 00:28:31.400
people wouldn't get married at all.

00:28:36.000 --> 00:28:39.140
I want to know everything about you.

00:28:43.480 --> 00:28:45.050
Stop it.

00:28:45.050 --> 00:28:46.610
I want to see the house

00:28:46.610 --> 00:28:48.220
in which she grew up.

00:28:48.220 --> 00:28:49.520
Can I do this?

00:28:49.950 --> 00:28:52.690
I'll be happy to take a walk with the Queen and catch up.

00:28:52.950 --> 00:28:55.490
This is an ordinary tradesman's house.

00:28:55.490 --> 00:28:56.930
Nothing special

00:28:56.930 --> 00:28:59.860
but I'll be happy to show you everything here.

00:29:00.730 --> 00:29:02.200
Then go together.

00:29:02.200 --> 00:29:04.400
The Queen must come with me.

00:29:06.100 --> 00:29:08.640
We didn't see each other for one night,

00:29:09.370 --> 00:29:11.670
but I miss you even when I look at you.

00:29:14.040 --> 00:29:15.640
You've got something stuck.

00:29:15.980 --> 00:29:17.710
This is a mole.

00:29:20.850 --> 00:29:23.790
It seemed to me that today you are different.

00:29:26.420 --> 00:29:29.220
You must come with us.

00:29:29.990 --> 00:29:31.090
Shall we go?

00:29:31.590 --> 00:29:35.300
Wait. The two of you take your time.

00:29:37.800 --> 00:29:41.540
I'll check if all the rooms are cleaned.

00:29:47.080 --> 00:29:48.210
Sorry.

00:29:52.010 --> 00:29:53.180
What are you doing?

00:29:53.250 --> 00:29:54.880
Distance, don't you remember?

00:29:54.880 --> 00:29:58.890
The longer I think, the more meaningful the phrase becomes.

00:29:59.420 --> 00:30:01.320
Even if we don't agree on everything,

00:30:01.760 --> 00:30:03.860
we can coexist happily.

00:30:04.430 --> 00:30:06.360
This is wonderful, right?

00:30:07.530 --> 00:30:09.230
Embracing our differences

00:30:09.230 --> 00:30:12.200
and overcoming them.

00:30:12.200 --> 00:30:13.970
Have you become a philosopher?

00:30:13.970 --> 00:30:16.240
Where has “distancing” taken you?

00:30:17.210 --> 00:30:21.140
Oh, exactly. After all, you are a politician.

00:30:22.740 --> 00:30:25.150
You saw how happy my father was when he saw us together.

00:30:25.150 --> 00:30:28.650
I'm trying to be a good son-in-law, help me.

00:30:31.950 --> 00:30:33.250
God.

00:30:49.300 --> 00:30:52.440
All the servants look unusually strong

00:30:52.440 --> 00:30:53.940
and dexterous.

00:30:54.280 --> 00:30:57.080
They know the layout of the house like the back of their hand.

00:30:57.080 --> 00:30:59.980
-Let's go.
-Certainly.

00:31:10.730 --> 00:31:13.830
I'm glad I asked you to show everything here.

00:31:15.900 --> 00:31:18.500
Of course, there are very valuable things here.

00:31:18.870 --> 00:31:20.640
So. Here, for example.

00:31:21.400 --> 00:31:24.240
White porcelain and folding screen.

00:31:24.540 --> 00:31:27.280
It wasn't easy for me to get them.

00:31:29.710 --> 00:31:31.950
Can I take a closer look?

00:31:31.950 --> 00:31:33.580
Yes, sure.

00:31:33.580 --> 00:31:35.450
Look here...

00:31:40.460 --> 00:31:43.930
There is nothing interesting on the other side.

00:31:44.190 --> 00:31:47.630
Even the reverse side of a work of art looks exquisite.

00:31:51.430 --> 00:31:52.830
Be careful, queen.

00:31:53.600 --> 00:31:56.870
-What's happened?
-To your dazzling beauty

00:31:56.870 --> 00:31:58.810
even the bees flock.

00:31:59.170 --> 00:32:01.810
-Bees?
-Where?

00:32:01.810 --> 00:32:03.540
-Where?
-There.

00:32:03.850 --> 00:32:05.350
- Be careful.
-There are no bees here.

00:32:07.020 --> 00:32:08.350
-Where? Where are they?
-God.

00:32:09.620 --> 00:32:11.350
-Where are they?
- Looks like they've flown away.

00:32:14.360 --> 00:32:16.560
My queen, what can you say about the screen?

00:32:20.830 --> 00:32:25.500
Strong brush strokes, great landscape painting.

00:32:25.770 --> 00:32:27.200
Darling, I guess.

00:32:28.970 --> 00:32:32.940
You are probably afraid that valuables may be stolen.

00:32:34.540 --> 00:32:37.980
I'm sure you have plenty of guards to guard them at night.

00:32:39.880 --> 00:32:42.750
No, I don't have a guard.

00:32:43.650 --> 00:32:46.550
These days it's more like hired guards

00:32:46.590 --> 00:32:49.460
will steal what they are supposed to protect.

00:32:50.090 --> 00:32:51.260
While?

00:32:51.430 --> 00:32:54.300
I have trained several servants who work for me

00:32:54.300 --> 00:32:56.460
whom I trust

00:32:56.460 --> 00:32:58.370
they perform guard duties.

00:32:58.370 --> 00:33:01.000
It's cheaper than hiring trained guards.

00:33:03.340 --> 00:33:04.910
You are very wise.

00:33:05.070 --> 00:33:07.280
And how many such servants do you have?

00:33:10.680 --> 00:33:14.550
This is classified information.

00:33:16.250 --> 00:33:19.590
Then you don't have to tell me.

00:33:21.060 --> 00:33:22.820
However my queen remains here

00:33:23.420 --> 00:33:24.730
I'm worried.

00:33:25.060 --> 00:33:26.490
My queen?

00:33:29.830 --> 00:33:31.970
26-27 somewhere.

00:33:33.470 --> 00:33:37.510
There can be no secrets between us.

00:33:40.980 --> 00:33:44.510
You have enough people to protect a 9-room estate.

00:33:45.110 --> 00:33:47.010
Your words calmed me down.

00:33:47.620 --> 00:33:49.750
I doubted whether you had any old books,

00:33:49.750 --> 00:33:51.850
dated two centuries earlier.

00:33:52.420 --> 00:33:56.820
Money alone is not enough to own such books.

00:33:57.190 --> 00:33:59.330
You will be very surprised.

00:33:59.690 --> 00:34:02.100
Is it true? Surprised?

00:34:08.200 --> 00:34:09.940
On your way to the library you will see

00:34:09.940 --> 00:34:11.670
the umbrella pine tree I cherished.

00:34:12.270 --> 00:34:16.340
The shape of its crown resembles a phoenix.

00:34:18.050 --> 00:34:21.320
I heard that if you plant a tree,

00:34:21.320 --> 00:34:23.480
a queen will appear in the family.

00:34:26.120 --> 00:34:27.920
The sign worked.

00:34:27.920 --> 00:34:30.160
Almost there. Follow me.

00:34:31.160 --> 00:34:32.730
Damn pine.

00:34:32.730 --> 00:34:34.760
This winter I will use it for firewood.

00:34:35.730 --> 00:34:39.130
Glad to hear your rude and arrogant remarks again.

00:34:40.740 --> 00:34:42.800
At first, when you changed,

00:34:43.370 --> 00:34:45.070
I thought you were abusing your power.

00:34:45.810 --> 00:34:47.310
Thought you were with your family

00:34:47.810 --> 00:34:49.640
trying to trample me.

00:34:50.410 --> 00:34:51.510
Misunderstanding.

00:34:51.850 --> 00:34:53.050
And you just...

00:34:54.150 --> 00:34:55.180
What?

00:34:55.620 --> 00:34:57.520
Just arrogant.

00:34:58.950 --> 00:35:02.090
I come from a wealthy family. I can afford it.

00:35:02.790 --> 00:35:05.990
I wasn't kidding when I said I wanted to understand you.

00:35:07.500 --> 00:35:09.100
I want to know

00:35:09.100 --> 00:35:13.600
how a woman from a noble family became like you in Joseon.

00:35:14.840 --> 00:35:16.300
Don't even try.

00:35:16.770 --> 00:35:19.610
A woman like me cannot exist in Joseon.

00:35:20.440 --> 00:35:22.740
"I am the most powerful in this world."

00:35:23.210 --> 00:35:24.780
You're definitely arrogant.

00:35:38.090 --> 00:35:39.230
Hurt.

00:35:51.610 --> 00:35:52.910
Return of the king to the throne after overthrow

00:35:52.910 --> 00:35:54.180
Return of the king to the throne after overthrow

00:36:20.270 --> 00:36:21.600
What happened to you?

00:36:24.870 --> 00:36:25.940
Nothing.

00:36:27.380 --> 00:36:28.410
God.

00:36:28.410 --> 00:36:32.480
His health has deteriorated due to worry about you.

00:36:32.680 --> 00:36:35.650
I'll call for help to take you inside.

00:36:35.650 --> 00:36:37.350
Keep an eye on him until I get back.

00:36:49.100 --> 00:36:50.230
What are you doing?

00:36:51.000 --> 00:36:52.870
Did you see a ghost?

00:36:58.270 --> 00:36:59.610
The smell of damp...

00:37:03.340 --> 00:37:04.480
Save me.

00:37:04.480 --> 00:37:07.850
It's my fault. I am to blame for the death.

00:37:11.120 --> 00:37:12.320
In this well...

00:37:25.600 --> 00:37:26.630
Your Majesty.

00:37:57.570 --> 00:37:59.600
Help the king. Hurry up.

00:38:00.400 --> 00:38:01.970
Main concubine?

00:38:03.100 --> 00:38:04.570
What's happened?

00:38:04.910 --> 00:38:06.310
You turned pale.

00:38:07.240 --> 00:38:08.310
Really...

00:38:10.950 --> 00:38:13.950
Father, escort the king inside.

00:38:16.350 --> 00:38:20.820
It seems the concubine has come to talk to me.

00:38:21.460 --> 00:38:23.690
I came here concerned about your health.

00:38:23.820 --> 00:38:25.830
But it seems the king is feeling bad.

00:38:25.990 --> 00:38:27.500
What happened?

00:38:27.500 --> 00:38:30.130
I didn't sleep last night.

00:38:30.870 --> 00:38:33.300
For a second I felt dizzy.

00:38:33.300 --> 00:38:35.570
I will accompany you to the guest house.

00:38:35.570 --> 00:38:36.870
The doctor has already been called.

00:38:37.370 --> 00:38:39.240
I don't need a doctor.

00:38:39.740 --> 00:38:42.310
I'll rest and everything will be fine.

00:38:43.310 --> 00:38:45.550
-Hurry up. Help His Majesty.
-Fine.

00:38:49.180 --> 00:38:50.380
Carefully.

00:39:02.130 --> 00:39:03.530
Be careful.

00:39:11.310 --> 00:39:12.810
You can go.

00:39:18.310 --> 00:39:19.780
Would you like to lie down?

00:39:20.350 --> 00:39:21.380
No.

00:39:22.780 --> 00:39:24.850
I'll sit and rest for a while.

00:39:27.050 --> 00:39:32.230
I heard you don't remember much about your time in Hanyang,

00:39:32.230 --> 00:39:34.430
you were very young then.

00:39:37.770 --> 00:39:39.870
I was still a child then.

00:39:41.340 --> 00:39:43.770
Due to an unpleasant event, I left Hanyang.

00:39:44.640 --> 00:39:46.570
I don't remember much.

00:39:46.940 --> 00:39:48.040
What a relief.

00:39:50.210 --> 00:39:54.050
That is, I wanted to say that it is better to let go

00:39:54.050 --> 00:39:55.780
bad memories.

00:39:58.520 --> 00:40:00.290
I think so too.

00:40:05.860 --> 00:40:08.460
This fool opened Pandora's box.

00:40:10.400 --> 00:40:12.470
You are not what they say.

00:40:13.730 --> 00:40:15.300
But I still doubted it.

00:40:17.300 --> 00:40:20.470
Don't worry. I didn't tell him anything.

00:40:23.510 --> 00:40:25.210
Isn't that why you're here?

00:40:25.210 --> 00:40:26.780
So what do you want?

00:40:27.150 --> 00:40:29.580
You didn't just lure him here for nothing.

00:40:32.050 --> 00:40:34.320
I really wanted to get along with you.

00:40:35.090 --> 00:40:37.360
You were my last hope.

00:40:37.660 --> 00:40:39.290
While I wanted you

00:40:39.290 --> 00:40:41.100
I could be myself.

00:40:43.300 --> 00:40:47.300
But I found out the truth about you.

00:40:48.440 --> 00:40:49.570
The truth?

00:40:53.470 --> 00:40:55.640
About you being a fake Kim So-yeon.

00:40:58.680 --> 00:41:00.150
you called me

00:41:01.220 --> 00:41:02.820
fake?

00:41:04.490 --> 00:41:05.650
I remembered everything.

00:41:05.950 --> 00:41:08.560
It's more like you showed your true colors.

00:41:11.360 --> 00:41:14.360
I'll help you, since
with you my hormones were raging.

00:41:14.800 --> 00:41:16.560
Confess everything to the king.

00:41:16.860 --> 00:41:19.000
It will be painful for him to learn about this from someone else.

00:41:19.000 --> 00:41:20.170
Are you threatening me?

00:41:21.540 --> 00:41:24.940
I heard you clearly.

00:41:28.980 --> 00:41:31.580
Your Majesty, I brought you some light snacks.

00:41:37.690 --> 00:41:39.820
How difficult it is to reach her.

00:41:40.620 --> 00:41:42.490
She's holding on to a complicated relationship

00:41:42.490 --> 00:41:45.030
I'm confused myself. Spoiled girl.

00:41:46.430 --> 00:41:47.490
Come in.

00:42:00.610 --> 00:42:01.640
Your Majesty.

00:42:03.810 --> 00:42:05.780
Have you talked to her yet?

00:42:07.380 --> 00:42:08.950
Leave us for a while.

00:42:11.920 --> 00:42:13.150
Are you okay?

00:42:13.150 --> 00:42:15.960
Sorry for making you worry about nothing.

00:42:18.590 --> 00:42:22.360
No need for formalities, we are alone here.

00:42:25.000 --> 00:42:28.500
Your Majesty,
the queen made a full recovery.

00:42:28.770 --> 00:42:30.370
Let's go back to the palace.

00:42:30.370 --> 00:42:31.410
I can't.

00:42:33.610 --> 00:42:35.240
I need to study something.

00:42:38.850 --> 00:42:40.510
Something to study?

00:42:41.850 --> 00:42:42.950
What exactly?

00:42:47.450 --> 00:42:48.760
Sorry.

00:42:49.220 --> 00:42:51.130
Forgive me my bad manners.

00:42:52.290 --> 00:42:55.800
I have prepared a room for you. Let me take you.

00:42:56.830 --> 00:42:58.970
I must return to the palace.

00:43:02.500 --> 00:43:05.340
Well, I'll wait for you at the palace.

00:43:05.670 --> 00:43:06.870
Take care of yourself.

00:44:09.880 --> 00:44:11.350
His grandfather was Prince Eunong.

00:44:11.680 --> 00:44:15.090
He was accused of treason, exiled and executed.

00:44:15.920 --> 00:44:17.350
His father was Prince Jeongye.

00:44:17.350 --> 00:44:19.020
Lived in exile with his father,

00:44:19.020 --> 00:44:20.790
fell ill and died.

00:44:20.890 --> 00:44:23.690
His grandmother and aunt were killed because of their baptism,

00:44:24.390 --> 00:44:26.000
and half-brother Lee Won-kyung

00:44:26.000 --> 00:44:27.500
killed for treason.

00:44:28.400 --> 00:44:30.200
This is not a TV show.

00:44:33.240 --> 00:44:35.570
Why did everyone in his family die?

00:44:41.680 --> 00:44:43.750
Why are you looking at me like that?

00:44:44.410 --> 00:44:46.750
How do I look?

00:44:47.620 --> 00:44:49.820
Like I'm a pathetic little dog.

00:44:51.050 --> 00:44:53.960
No need to smile. I'm worried about you.

00:44:54.560 --> 00:44:58.100
Apparently, therefore, early education only harms.

00:44:58.360 --> 00:44:59.930
What useless knowledge!

00:45:01.900 --> 00:45:04.000
You. What do you want from me?

00:45:04.000 --> 00:45:05.170
Why did you stick to me?

00:45:06.170 --> 00:45:08.140
What do I want from you?

00:45:08.810 --> 00:45:13.240
If the queen suddenly interferes with our plans,

00:45:16.080 --> 00:45:19.620
I will personally behead her.

00:45:21.690 --> 00:45:24.590
I want you not to interfere with me.

00:45:25.960 --> 00:45:28.790
You don't have to help me. Just

00:45:29.530 --> 00:45:31.230
don't become my enemy.

00:45:34.730 --> 00:45:36.400
And you have a trained eye.

00:45:36.400 --> 00:45:38.640
I may not be able to help much with anything,

00:45:38.640 --> 00:45:40.070
but as an enemy I am terrible.

00:45:40.070 --> 00:45:41.510
I'll grab hold of you and won't let go.

00:45:43.610 --> 00:45:44.680
Your Majesty!

00:45:50.310 --> 00:45:52.620
Kim Byonin has come to see you.

00:46:09.830 --> 00:46:12.240
How many guests do I have today?

00:46:12.940 --> 00:46:14.770
They come to me like they go to a restaurant.

00:46:25.150 --> 00:46:26.580
Are you okay?

00:46:26.650 --> 00:46:28.620
I'd say too good.

00:46:30.150 --> 00:46:31.390
Any problems?

00:46:31.660 --> 00:46:33.290
Why is the head of the Detective Department here?

00:46:33.960 --> 00:46:36.690
While the king and queen are here,

00:46:36.930 --> 00:46:39.030
It should be like a palace here.

00:46:39.330 --> 00:46:40.500
Your Majesty.

00:46:41.330 --> 00:46:44.070
From now on, you are under the protection of the Detective Department.

00:46:45.300 --> 00:46:49.110
I brought the royal guards with me, you have nothing to worry about.

00:46:51.210 --> 00:46:53.810
Then you will be protected by the royal guard,

00:46:53.810 --> 00:46:56.550
and we will protect the queen.

00:46:56.980 --> 00:46:58.980
Are there too many people?

00:46:58.980 --> 00:47:01.450
Then you can recall the royal guards.

00:47:14.200 --> 00:47:16.830
You are not in your right place.

00:47:17.070 --> 00:47:19.000
To protect us

00:47:20.100 --> 00:47:21.940
look around, not at us.

00:47:29.110 --> 00:47:33.080
Apparently, my destiny is to be surrounded by those who look at me.

00:47:44.460 --> 00:47:45.630
Who is this?

00:48:02.380 --> 00:48:03.510
Everything is fine?

00:48:06.450 --> 00:48:08.820
Wait, this...

00:48:10.450 --> 00:48:11.690
Why is he here?

00:48:13.360 --> 00:48:14.560
Do you know him?

00:48:15.990 --> 00:48:18.200
Come to your senses, wake up.

00:48:21.130 --> 00:48:22.370
Save me, Benin.

00:48:22.830 --> 00:48:23.970
Benin?

00:48:24.840 --> 00:48:27.370
Why did he try to attack the queen?

00:48:27.670 --> 00:48:29.740
She could have gotten hurt.

00:48:29.740 --> 00:48:32.740
Go away, woman! Get out of this body!

00:48:32.740 --> 00:48:34.510
-Leave.
-Queen.

00:48:41.950 --> 00:48:45.360
What did this chatterbox forget here?

00:48:48.330 --> 00:48:50.330
What were you thinking?

00:48:50.560 --> 00:48:53.330
I really wanted to see her face.

00:48:55.870 --> 00:48:57.800
Right. I...

00:49:00.140 --> 00:49:01.470
In Joseon I...

00:49:01.470 --> 00:49:03.540
Mrs. Hong Young.

00:49:06.510 --> 00:49:08.010
queen.

00:49:12.120 --> 00:49:14.220
He wanted to see your maid.

00:49:16.350 --> 00:49:18.690
Does he really not recognize me like this?

00:49:22.230 --> 00:49:24.690
You said you would protect the queen

00:49:25.500 --> 00:49:27.200
but they only showed their vulnerability.

00:49:28.530 --> 00:49:30.130
Why are you so unhappy?

00:49:30.130 --> 00:49:31.700
Detective department?

00:49:31.870 --> 00:49:34.170
Are you up to something?

00:49:34.640 --> 00:49:36.670
What could I be up to?

00:49:39.780 --> 00:49:43.150
Recently, many warehouses have been robbed in the capital.

00:49:43.250 --> 00:49:46.520
-And what?
-We need to strengthen security measures.

00:49:47.580 --> 00:49:49.290
But if you prevent it,

00:49:51.250 --> 00:49:54.760
is it possible that you make money from this?

00:49:55.130 --> 00:49:59.030
Take it easy, despite his past,
he is still the king.

00:50:03.330 --> 00:50:07.600
Let's find out today.

00:50:08.370 --> 00:50:09.840
I'm very glad.

00:50:22.850 --> 00:50:25.420
I myself am a skilled warrior, and I have the right instincts,

00:50:25.720 --> 00:50:29.230
it wouldn't cost me much
difficulty dodging blows.

00:50:29.460 --> 00:50:32.330
I wanted to discuss something with you

00:50:32.600 --> 00:50:34.300
that's why I asked to come.

00:50:35.130 --> 00:50:37.530
Yes? That's it.

00:50:38.570 --> 00:50:41.470
I also have one request for you.

00:50:42.170 --> 00:50:44.410
I don't know if it's possible to ask for this.

00:50:47.240 --> 00:50:48.650
What kind of request?

00:50:50.180 --> 00:50:53.480
Won't you blow on my bruises?

00:51:03.190 --> 00:51:05.700
Even your breath is fragrant.

00:51:07.830 --> 00:51:12.300
Now I'm completely confused, what now

00:51:12.300 --> 00:51:13.540
I'm experiencing.

00:51:14.940 --> 00:51:17.940
There's only one way to know for sure.

00:51:19.780 --> 00:51:20.810
Sorry in advance.

00:51:22.310 --> 00:51:23.380
But I have to find out.

00:51:34.660 --> 00:51:35.860
What are you doing here?

00:51:35.930 --> 00:51:38.300
Sorry for not recognizing such an important husband.

00:51:40.760 --> 00:51:42.870
What kind of smile is this?

00:51:42.970 --> 00:51:44.900
A smile with which I beg for forgiveness.

00:51:45.270 --> 00:51:48.570
My breath is fragrant, and my smile is even more beautiful.

00:52:10.930 --> 00:52:12.130
And you know a lot about drinking.

00:52:24.040 --> 00:52:25.940
You can handle alcohol quite well yourself.

00:52:27.440 --> 00:52:28.710
Of course, that's why I'm the king.

00:53:00.240 --> 00:53:01.710
Have they already drunk that much?

00:53:04.480 --> 00:53:06.020
Well, now it's that time.

00:53:06.380 --> 00:53:08.790
-ERV.
-ERV?

00:53:09.090 --> 00:53:10.620
Time of the dog and the wolf.

00:53:12.620 --> 00:53:14.520
The hour when all the veils are torn off,

00:53:14.800 --> 00:53:17.300
those who coexisted peacefully during the day,
they squabble like dogs and wolves.

00:53:41.450 --> 00:53:44.120
Answer me as husband to husband.

00:53:45.760 --> 00:53:47.060
You're nothing

00:53:49.330 --> 00:53:52.800
don't you have feelings for my queen?

00:53:53.760 --> 00:53:56.030
Only feelings for her

00:53:56.030 --> 00:53:58.270
can explain your hostility towards me.

00:53:59.270 --> 00:54:02.870
There are all sorts of donkeys in the world.

00:54:04.670 --> 00:54:07.110
There are those who themselves
they don’t feel anything for the virgin,

00:54:08.650 --> 00:54:12.380
but they can’t allow her to be with anyone else.

00:54:17.420 --> 00:54:22.660
Am I the bossy ass?

00:54:31.500 --> 00:54:33.170
The best of women is next to you,

00:54:33.170 --> 00:54:34.870
and you don't notice it.

00:54:37.740 --> 00:54:39.610
Like eating a donkey, a complete fool.

00:54:42.310 --> 00:54:44.110
Take it easy, guys.

00:54:44.110 --> 00:54:46.280
I'm not interested in any of you.

00:54:48.850 --> 00:54:49.890
You're lying.

00:54:51.220 --> 00:54:52.620
I know you like me.

00:54:55.690 --> 00:54:57.090
Look into my eyes.

00:55:02.370 --> 00:55:03.430
Or are you...

00:55:13.940 --> 00:55:17.050
A wise king should be complacent,

00:55:18.580 --> 00:55:19.720
but victory is mine.

00:55:22.690 --> 00:55:23.720
It's funny.

00:55:27.020 --> 00:55:28.530
It's time for you to repay my kindness.

00:56:06.200 --> 00:56:08.500
So we met again.

00:56:09.270 --> 00:56:11.170
Although I tried to stay away

00:56:11.170 --> 00:56:13.040
so as not to bother you again.

00:56:13.040 --> 00:56:15.340
Why, Queen Mother, you don’t bother me at all.

00:56:15.770 --> 00:56:17.210
I have a gift for you.

00:56:32.590 --> 00:56:33.590
This is...

00:56:33.590 --> 00:56:36.930
If anyone deserves to be near the king, it's you.

00:56:37.590 --> 00:56:41.060
The title of Her Majesty suits you much better.

00:56:50.940 --> 00:56:52.880
What were you looking at, child?

00:56:56.110 --> 00:57:00.050
Admired the reflection of the moon in the waters.

00:57:00.380 --> 00:57:03.620
Within the walls of the palace you can hear many scary stories.

00:57:04.050 --> 00:57:06.390
About ghosts, for example.

00:57:07.620 --> 00:57:12.160
One such story is that you shouldn't

00:57:12.530 --> 00:57:15.730
look into the waters of the reservoir,
when the moon is full.

00:57:17.630 --> 00:57:19.440
Because when you turn away,

00:57:19.440 --> 00:57:23.540
and your reflection will take on a life of its own.

00:57:29.810 --> 00:57:31.010
It seems to me

00:57:32.450 --> 00:57:34.750
as if until now I was somewhere at the bottom of a reservoir.

00:57:41.620 --> 00:57:42.730
Now

00:57:44.230 --> 00:57:46.100
It's time to come to the surface.

00:58:37.550 --> 00:58:39.050
I could have waited for the elder.

00:58:39.050 --> 00:58:40.280
Looks like it was pressed hard.

00:58:43.420 --> 00:58:45.760
Stand. The needy is on that side.

00:59:24.930 --> 00:59:26.730
There is something that I have hidden from you.

00:59:27.930 --> 00:59:29.870
Something I kept secret from everyone.

00:59:29.870 --> 00:59:31.800
What only Her Majesty and I know.

00:59:39.780 --> 00:59:42.080
During the full moon, werewolves turn

00:59:42.680 --> 00:59:44.880
into wolves.

00:59:47.320 --> 00:59:48.850
However, we all

00:59:50.450 --> 00:59:54.060
We know very well that the full moon is just an excuse,

00:59:54.060 --> 00:59:58.030
to release the wolf that has always been hidden inside.

01:00:33.960 --> 01:00:35.400
What is it, a chamber pot?

01:00:36.130 --> 01:00:39.740
It’s no good doing things in such beauty.

01:01:43.470 --> 01:01:44.530
Tango?

01:02:19.770 --> 01:02:20.900
Have you come to your senses?

01:02:24.010 --> 01:02:25.880
Take me to Her Majesty's chambers.

01:02:26.140 --> 01:02:27.510
I will guard her personally.

01:03:26.040 --> 01:03:27.140
Queen?

01:03:28.470 --> 01:03:31.310
What a bastard, why are you offending my poor king?

01:03:34.280 --> 01:03:36.410
I bring retribution

01:03:36.880 --> 01:03:40.280
in the name of the moon!

01:03:49.000 --> 01:03:51.300
I only drank a little
and grace became like a potato.

01:03:52.360 --> 01:03:55.400
Come on, get up. Still good?

01:04:02.240 --> 01:04:04.610
Why did you expose yourself to attack?

01:04:07.010 --> 01:04:08.140
There he is!

01:04:16.150 --> 01:04:18.320
Let's forget about distancing today.

01:04:24.430 --> 01:04:25.560
Your Majesty.

01:04:26.500 --> 01:04:27.860
Are you okay?

01:05:11.140 --> 01:05:12.910
You can't help but get into trouble.

01:05:12.910 --> 01:05:16.310
It would be very unfortunate if you forgot last night.

01:05:16.410 --> 01:05:18.280
You can always buy a name plate.

01:05:18.280 --> 01:05:20.250
Who knows? Suddenly he is under someone else's guise

01:05:20.250 --> 01:05:22.020
came here to start a rebellion.

01:05:22.020 --> 01:05:23.820
It's all my fault.

01:05:23.820 --> 01:05:25.960
I had to keep my mouth shut.

01:05:25.960 --> 01:05:27.260
Let's make a little excursion.

01:05:27.260 --> 01:05:28.960
Ingratiates himself with the Kims

01:05:28.960 --> 01:05:30.660
that almost his entire family was slaughtered.

01:05:30.660 --> 01:05:32.390
Speak, but don't talk.

01:05:33.960 --> 01:05:35.500
-Who else are you?
-I

01:05:35.500 --> 01:05:37.070
I am a member of the king's fan club.
